{"id":"vod_sn_36650","vodId":"36650","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"理想禁区","name_cn":"理想禁区","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2744dcfb4cffc07a49089f3bd9c2eee9.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《理想禁区》改编自李晓楠原作的同名网络漫画，动画由日本绘梦负责制作。在现代社会的青春期少年少女之间蔓延着一种“症状”。孤独感、反抗心、受到排挤。对于这样的年轻人们而言，网络世界是唯一的救赎。不知不觉沉浸于网络世界的他们的这一症状，被命名为“网络成瘾”。之后，以“将年轻人再次导向正道”之名目，某所重生设施诞生了。但，被这一设施所收容的网络成瘾患者之一“响”，等待着他的并非重生教育，而完全就是监狱。在这不允许从内部逃脱的设施，响能否从地狱般的绝望当中逃离——！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WUeafBjtd91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eu2p7c51du1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JNHK0Lt23d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CbZEH8veNL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/icNXj4rVWv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LbTrpW5hV21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bzdG1RHTkf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bZF1xrfdKy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eTyfeb83Q01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N3LSyDnnuq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fcEqdbXexJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KEbZ0yRf7A1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:20.602Z"}